MODULE: NoLostWriteUnflaggedDrift
TARGET: NoLostWrite
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an out-of-band view mutation is not recorded as drift, so the regression reads as a lost write
PERTURBS: Drift

--- FIND
    /\ driftUsed' = driftUsed + 1 /\ drifted' = TRUE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<SourceVars, trim, ttlUsed, crashes, bound, applied, hw, ckpt,
--- REPLACE
    /\ driftUsed' = driftUsed + 1
    /\ UNCHANGED <<SourceVars, trim, ttlUsed, crashes, drifted, bound, applied, hw, ckpt,
--- END
